cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use bioRtools, please cite this software and the archived release."
type: software
title: "bioRtools: Reproducible Analysis-to-Figure Workflows for Omics Data"
abstract: >-
  bioRtools provides a reproducible analysis-to-figure contract for multivariate
  omics workflows. Core methods preserve native statistical model objects while
  returning validated result tables, composable ggplot2 figures, and provenance
  metadata.
authors:
